From: Project Luma <builds@projectluma.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] Recover desktop resize, scaling, input and close behavior

Applies after 0001-0004 and 0007 to the pinned source. Bounded retries use
actual Android task bounds and generation-safe cancellation, off the Wayland
thread. Includes unmodified Figtree copyright/OFL in vendor and source.
No HIDL, privilege or display ABI changes.

